### 1. Health check de reservas (Python)
GET http://localhost:7701/health

### 2. Crear una reserva (Python)
PUT http://localhost:7701/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seat_num": "14A",
  "flight_id": "AA2532",
  "customer_id": "user-999"
}

### 3. Consultar reservas (Python)
GET http://localhost:7701/reservations?flight_id=AA2532

### 4. Buscar vuelo (Node.js)
GET http://localhost:5501/flights?flight_no=AA2532


#######

### 1. Health check de reservas (Python a través de Traefik)
GET http://localhost:9080/reservations/health

### 2. Crear una reserva (Python a través de Traefik)
PUT http://localhost:9080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seat_num": "14A",
  "flight_id": "AA2532",
  "customer_id": "user-999"
}

### 3. Consultar reservas (Python a través de Traefik)
GET http://localhost:9080/reservations?flight_id=AA2532

### 4. Buscar vuelo (Node.js a través de Traefik)
GET http://localhost:9080/flights?flight_no=AA2532

### 5. Probar Pagos (Go a través de Traefik)
POST http://localhost:9080/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservation_id": "res-999",
  "amount": 250.50
}
